    "updated_at": "2026-10-15T12:48:27Z",
    "body": "Hi @Berk-Unsal, I\u2019d like to contribute to this issue. I can work on creating GitHub issue forms for reproducible planning bugs and scoped feature/research proposals, following the repository\u2019s existing conventions.\n\nCould you please assign this issue to me? I\u2019ll ensure the forms capture the required reproduction details and proposal scope, use valid GitHub issue-form YAML and existing labels, and clearly warn contributors not to share secrets, private campaign locations, or raw route data. I\u2019ll also validate the forms against the acceptance criteria.\n\nThank you for the opportunity to contribute to A.T.O.M!\n",
